# Audit exclusions for `tama find-violations`: paths fixed by something
# outside this project.
#
# The repository root is the site root. Every file here is served at its own
# path, so the path IS the public address: index.html is the home page,
# robots.txt and sitemap.xml are well-known URLs crawlers fetch by name,
# favicon.svg is the icon, and styles.css and script.js are what the page
# links. .gitignore and .wisent-release.json are read by their tools at
# exactly this path, and VERSION is the version source .wisent-release.json
# names. Moving any of them renames a public address or breaks a tool.
.
# Two published pages, not modules. This site is raw HTML served per path:
# one page is one topic at one address, and every page carries the site
# navigation inline because there is no include mechanism. The CLI reference
# is the index over docs/cli/<command>/ and the runbook is one procedure read
# top to bottom; splitting either one invents addresses nothing links to.
docs/cli/index.html
docs/runbook/index.html
